# devices/akita/drivers/input/conf: the Pixel 8a's own input drivers (docs/drivers-config.md, docs/porting/drivers.md).

driver AKITA_KEYS
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.akita_keys.c
	help    the Pixel 8a's power and volume keys: three pins of zuma's always-on pin controller, read (buttons=1)

driver AKITA_TOUCH
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.akita_touch.c
	help    the Pixel 8a's touch screen: a Goodix GT9895 on the SPI controller of zuma's HSI0 USI2, polled (touchscreen=1; U-Boot powers it)
